# Exclude everything except the API server and its single dependency.
# Without this, Docker copies 4GB+ (data/, mobile_app/node_modules, .git)
# which causes Railway builds to time out or take 10+ minutes.

# data/ is excluded child-by-child (the `data/*` glob form, not a single bare
# `data/` rule) so the negation below can re-include data/knowledge_base/ —
# Docker can't un-exclude a path whose parent was excluded via a bare `data/`
# rule. Found 2026-07-09: ops_runbook.md/ceo_learnings.md and every other
# knowledge_base reference doc never existed inside the container at all (on
# top of being ephemeral before a Volume existed) — this exclusion swallowed
# them outright. knowledge_base/ is ~700KB, negligible next to the ~4GB it's
# carved out of (digital_products/, backups/, and the many per-product dirs).
data/*
!data/knowledge_base
!data/registered_commands.json
mobile_app/
.git/

# Python cruft
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
*.egg-info/

# Secrets (Railway injects these via env vars — never bake them in the image)
.env
*.env

# Dev / CI noise
.github/
.pytest_cache/
*.md
!data/knowledge_base/*.md

# Local DB (never ship into the image)
**/hub_data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
